# Local projects opened by the F5 "Run Extension (prj<n>)" configurations: PROJECT_1 -> prj1, ...
# Copy to .env, or export the same variables in your shell (they win over .env).
# Then run `npm run launch` (the compile task before F5 runs it too) to regenerate .vscode/launch.json.
PROJECT_1=/path/to/first/project
PROJECT_2=/path/to/second/project
